# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
# Template/example files carry no secrets and should be committed so a new
# clone has the documented variable list — `!.env.example` alone didn't match
# `frontend/.env.local.example` (Phase 11 hygiene check, `PROJECT_SPEC.md` §31).
!.env*.example

